Deployment Steps

### 1️⃣ Create Kubernetes Cluster using Kops
```bash
kops create cluster --name=mahesh.k8s.local --state=s3://<your-s3-bucket> --zones=us-east-1a --node-count=2 --node-size=t2.medium --master-size=t2.medium --dns-zone=mahesh.k8s.local
kops update cluster --name mahesh.k8s.local --yes
2️⃣ Verify Cluster
kubectl get nodes
3️⃣ Create Namespace
kubectl create namespace bookstore
4️⃣ Deploy Application using Helm
cd bookstore-chart
helm install bookstore ./ --namespace bookstore
5️⃣ Verify Resources
kubectl get all -n bookstore
6️⃣ Get LoadBalancer URL
kubectl get svc frontend -n bookstore
Open in browser:

http://<loadbalancer-dns>
